  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IMPLEMENTATION of the EU GUEST of HONOUR at the INTERNATIONAL BOOK FAIR OF GUADALAJARA ACTIVITIES.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The EU has accepted to participate as Guest of Honour (GoH) at the Guadalajara International Book Fair (FIL) at its 2023 edition.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The EU participation as GoH will broaden cultural relations and encourage cooperation and co-creation between the EU, its MS, and the LAC region while supporting global circulation of European cultural works and artists; enhance the EU&#xbf;s role and relevance for LAC and globally, focusing particularly on youth (who make up most of the subcontinent&#xbf;s population); generate strategic public and cultural diplomacy actions that could be a template to reproduce and adapt to other global regions. The selection of writers, intellectuals and artists will represent the diversity (in geography, themes, and gender) and modernity of European literature/arts/thinking. Sustainable development, the green transition and climate change will be important themes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;This contract shall serve to implement the activities of the EU GoH at the international book fair of Guadalajara.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
